[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_script")
id = "farmers_ledger"
display_name = "Farmer's Ledger"
description = "Harvest accounts, written for the feast and kept after it."
category = 3
tint = Color(0.55, 0.5, 0.36, 1)
author = "Aldous Thorn, farmer"
region_id = "thornfield"
lore_text = "Harvest accounts, Thornfield, the year the wheat came in clean.

Twelve sheaves to the Crown tithe. Four calves, all sound.

Feast night: the castle sent wine and roast mutton for every hearth. We ate in the south field under the lanterns. Everyone sang.

Morning after: the grass has grown pale overnight. Not dried, pale, like linen left too long in the moon. The scythe will not bite it.

Marta keeps standing in the field facing the castle. Hours at a time. She said only, the window is lit.

The cattle stopped making sound at dusk. Not stopped lowing. Stopped. Their mouths still move.

Tithe is due at the gate on the first day of the new moon. I will take the cart myself. If I do not come back, the ledger is -"
